# Agreement Extension Calculation

This scope determines the automatic extension date of the agreement provisions.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementExtension:
  output automatic_extension_end_date content date
```

The agreement is automatically extended for one year after 31 December 1998.

```catala
scope AgreementExtension:
  date round down
  definition automatic_extension_end_date equals |1998-12-31| + 1 year
```